  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f8b2c561-5bd4-4bc5-8016-9c2be6e8a677-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 229px;\" /><br /><br />Net torque about suspension is zero,&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mfrac><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mfrac><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>M</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi></math>, where,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mfrac><mi>l</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi></math><br />it is the equation of straight line with variable <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math>.</p>",
